SUMMARY:The Flame Within
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nA weekly Wednesday morning circle for spi
 ritual kinksters\, sensual seekers\, witches\, lovers\, shadow-workers\, a
 nd the kink-curious who want to explore the deeper layers beneath desire.\
 nThis is a space for the parts of us that don’t always fit neatly into e
 veryday life: the sacred\, the sexual\, the curious\, the complicated\, th
 e powerful\, the tender\, the hungry\, the healing\, the hidden.\n\n$20 RS
 VP Strongly suggested [at this link](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FA
 IpQLSezke4QJf6Vdwt0y3Di08XxMizntChymmHLCxMBOpf8xCApiA/viewform?usp=sharing
 &ouid=109188294329093739010).\n\nEach week offers a different doorway into
  self-knowledge and embodied exploration\, such as:\n✦ Desire and erotic
  self-discovery\n✦ Shadow work and shame alchemy\n✦ Tarot\, oracle\, m
 agick\, and divination\n✦ Sensual journaling and self-expression\n✦ Mo
 on rituals and symbolic practice\n✦ Body wisdom and nervous system aware
 ness\n✦ Kink-informed conversations around power\, consent\, and boundar
 ies\n✦ Brave intimacy\, vulnerability\, and communication\n\nThis is an 
 all-gender\, 18+\, clothed\, facilitated\, consent-centered circle. All or
 ientations\, relationship structures\, identities\, and experience levels 
 are welcome.\n\nYou are welcome to share deeply\, lightly\, or not at all.
 \n\nBring your curiosity. Bring your contradictions. Bring the self you’
 re still learning how to claim.\n\nCoffee and tea provided. Bring your own
  mug.
